================================================================================
PROVENANCE - WHO BUILT THIS GRAPH, STATED BEFORE ITS NUMBERS ARE USED
================================================================================

  This graph was written by PROVISIONING, not by this run, over the 62-archive
  staging tree /opt/blitzy-harness/cpg-input inventoried in
  harness/artifacts/logs/cpg-input-inventory.json. This run's own frontend
  invocation over the full-reactor build's complete 191-archive input set
  failed at flatgraph's string-pool ceiling and wrote no graph
  (harness/artifacts/logs/cpg-frontend.log; the mechanism re-verified at two
  heaps in harness/artifacts/logs/cpg-ceiling-reverify.log). The AAP
  requirement that the graph be created by this run over every JAR the build
  produced is UNMET, is unmeetable at this pin, and is published as a
  divergence. What this file establishes is what the graph the Joern stages DO
  load contains - never that it is the graph the AAP asked for.

  The environment record harness/ENVIRONMENT.md describes a different graph -
  541,255,894 bytes, sha256 26d327cc...fcffc, 1,397,339 methods - which is not
  on disk. That contradiction is the second gate halt
  (gate.environment_record_graph_identity_agreement) and both values are
  recorded wherever either is cited.

